OL,8,     F@1Xtra on social.
OL,9,G0030 1Xtra's R&B Slow Jamz Mix with
OL,10,G     Chuckie
OL,11,     FChuckie mixes up R&B slow jams.
OL,12,     FPlaying hits from Janet Jackson,
OL,13,     FDrake, Jhene Aiko and more.
OL,14,G0100 1Xtra's Throwback Thursday
OL,15,     F2007 was iconic. Soulja Boy had us
OL,16,     Fdancing, Umbrella topped the
OL,17,     Fcharts and the iPhone changed the
OL,18,     Fgame. These bangers defined an
OL,19,     Fera. Press play, turn it up and
OL,20,     Frelive it all.
